(function(){var C=window.__CLIPS||(window.__CLIPS={});var d={"Press Begin when you are ready.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Worked example.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. Have another look, or use a hint.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. That's fine. You can try again, or move on without an answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose an answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Type your answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put all of them in order first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort all of them first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You explored new possibilities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New idea explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You worked through something difficult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Challenge explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You stayed with the challenge.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strong persistence.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You tried a different approach when your first idea did not work.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New strategy discovered.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You kept trying.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Learning continued.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You looked carefully before deciding.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Careful observation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Number patterns and flow diagrams.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Today I am practising finding the rule in a number pattern.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Patterns follow a rule.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A number pattern follows a rule. In 4, 8, 12, 16 the rule is add 4 each time.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Some patterns multiply.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Some patterns grow by multiplying. In 3, 6, 12, 24 the rule is multiply by 2.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Flow diagrams.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A flow diagram has an input, a rule and an output. If the rule is times 5, an input of 3 gives an output of 15.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Find the next two numbers: 7, 14, 21, 28, …": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Find the difference between the numbers: 14 − 7 = 7, and 21 − 14 = 7.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The difference stays the same, so the rule is add 7.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "28 + 7 = 35, and 35 + 7 = 42. The next two numbers are 35 and 42.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is the next number? 5, 10, 15, 20, …": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "25": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "30": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "21": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "24": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Look at how much the numbers grow each time.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Work out 10 − 5 and 15 − 10.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The pattern adds 5 each time. What is 20 + 5?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The rule is add 5, so 20 + 5 = 25.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is the rule? 100, 90, 80, 70": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Subtract 10": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Add 10": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Subtract 20": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Divide by 10": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Are the numbers getting bigger or smaller?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Work out 100 − 90.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The numbers get 10 smaller each time.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Each number is 10 less than the one before, so the rule is subtract 10.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The rule is × 4. The input is 6. What is the output?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "10": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "64": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "20": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Multiplying means making equal groups.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You need 6 groups of 4.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Count in 4s six times: 4, 8, 12, 16, 20, …": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "6 × 4 = 24.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The rule is + 25. The output is 75. What was the input?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "50": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "100": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "75": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Work backwards from the output.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The opposite of adding is subtracting.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Work out 75 − 25.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Working backwards, 75 − 25 = 50. Check: 50 + 25 = 75.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What number is missing? 3, 6, 12, __, 48": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "18": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "36": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The numbers grow faster each time. Is the pattern adding or multiplying?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "6 is 3 × 2, and 12 is 6 × 2.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Multiply 12 by 2.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The rule is multiply by 2: 12 × 2 = 24, and 24 × 2 = 48.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Thandi saves R15 every week. She starts with nothing. How much has she saved after 6 weeks?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "R90": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "R21": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "R75": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "R60": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The savings make a pattern: R15, R30, R45, …": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Keep adding R15 until you have 6 numbers.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "15 × 6 = 90.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "R15 × 6 = R90. The pattern is 15, 30, 45, 60, 75, 90.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What helped you find the rule?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Finding the difference": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Working backwards": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Counting in groups": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not sure": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Number patterns are everywhere: in times tables, calendars and savings.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Pattern. things that follow a rule.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Rule. what you do to get the next number.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Input. the number that goes in.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Output. the number that comes out.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};for(var k in d)C[k]=d[k];})();
